front of the hat, and he was mute.

Don't know how shrinking could be useful for Nethack, but wearing the  
hat should impose inability to speak in any case. ("You can't open your  
mouth!" or some such.) Perhaps for pacifists, to quietly sneak away or  
hide under some garbage. (Inventory would shrink with the character;  
careful you don't drop anything because it stays small when you revert.  
Too small to spot when normal size, and next time you shrink or come  
back to the spot after moving away you can't find it - basically the  
objects are gone then. Special objects could refuse to leave you just  
as, IIRC, some won't go into a bag (of holding?).)

